  <book code="2CO" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:32:25 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Kô-rin-tô đu bơơr</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kô-rin-tô</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Co</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kô-rin-tô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Phaau-lô, sưưq-đô Jê-su ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih tââq kanóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq manưih adhi anó Ti-mô-thê, pagơơi đóng Akóón Dhơn Chuôq ưng Yaang Pleng tơơt dhiq Kô-rin-tô, palơq đóng pabhơt nôôq manưih huuiq tơơt dhiq kalóóng plok parah A-chaai: <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Nhan ơơn phươk liêm lơq yươq rauha tââq Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he, lơq Chuôq, Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, tơk dhiq adhi anó!<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Đaang bhi haanh Yaang Pleng lơq ama ưng Chuôq nôôq he, Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq nek Ama ưng rau ka-yô ka-er, lơq Yaang Pleng ưng dyóp rau bhơơl pahêêl, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />nek Yaang bhơơl pahêêl nôôq yi kalóóng dyóp rau bhrê hư ưng nôôq yi, đââng tơk tarnêêng têêng đóng nôôq yi ve chóóm bhơơl pahêêl nôôq ngaai tơơt kalóóng dyóp rau bhrê hư palơq rau bhơơl pahêêl hơq chênh nôôq yi bâân bhơơl pahêêl tââq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ơi kơi nôôq kadhaap jarnah ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih hóói bhlaai dhiq nôôq yi n'đó kơi, nek rau bhơơl pahêêl ưng nôôq yi tapâng dhiq Chuôq Paq Manưih kung hóói bhlaai kơi achêk. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Bơơi la nôôq yi đơơp bhrê hư, hơq achêk nek taai rau bhơơl pahêêl lơq rau paq jóói ưng adhi anó, la nôôq yi bâân bhơơl pahêêl hơq achêk nek taai rau bhơơl pahêêl ưng adhi anó, nek rau bâân n'nal kơi kalóóng tarnêêng đơơp jruôn palơq nôôq kadhaap jarnah hơq chênh nôôq yi kung dyơq jruôn. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Lơq rau lóóm rââm ưng nôôq yi leq adhi anó nek dhakơi, xók n'nal kakơi kơi adhi anó nek nôôq manưih ting pâng phơn kalóóng rau kadhaap jarnah n'đó kơi, nek kung pâng phơn kalóóng rau tabhơơl pahêêl kơi achêk.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Nhan móón adhi anó, taai nôôq yi kah kiêng adhi anó kah bâân n'nal leq nôôq kadhaap jarnah ơi vaaih tơk đóng nôôq yi dhiq A-si, kơi nôôq yi ơi đơơp gưi geng kuôq lalơh, lơh piing praan karơ tơk mơ nôôq yi patơk mơ pabhơt kah ve rau rââm buôn mamông. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Dhơ kơi ađek, chênh nôôq yi biêh ơi ve bha-aar tanóóm leng dhiq kalóóng ađêi, hơq đóng nôôq yi kah ve chóóm ganơơm dhiq ađêi kala, bơơi nek dhiq Yaang Pleng, Yaang têêng manưih chêt mamông lóóiq, <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />nek Yaang ơi jóói paq nôôq yi lơh tââq rau chêt gamak kơi tôôh, nek Ađó e paq jóói nôôq yi, hơq nek tââq dhiq Ađó, nôôq yi ve lóóm rââm kơi Ađó kung e hayơq paq jóói nôôq yi dyơq, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Xók adhi anó kung tapâng phơn poor jóói dhiq rau gavơh nhan ơi taai nôôq yi, hơq đóng yuur vaaih tââq bơk ngaai, ơơn liêm bhral dhiq nôôq yi, Yaang Pleng đơơp pei nôôq paraaq ma-ơơn tââq bơk ngaai ơi taai nôôq yi.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Ơi rau tarhơơnh ưng nôôq yi nek nô kơi: paraaq truuih ưng lóóm kanóq nôôq yi, kơi nôôq yi ơi cha tơơt m'pơng manưih hóng katiêk kalóóng rau sek chadhah lơq lalua dhalam ưng Yaang Pleng, eh rau tââq tarbech galang ting manưih ti, bơơi tââq ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq tââm nek palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Ơi nôôq yi kah xaraq đóng adhi anó harau đu lââng, lơh nôôq rau hơq adhi anó chóóm đok lơq chóóm n'nal. Bơơi aku rââm kơi adhi anó e n'nal đóng bhơt, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kung kơi adhi anó ơi n'nal nôôq yi m'bưưiq, kơi nôôq yi nek rau tarhơơnh ưng adhi anó, nek adhi anó kung kơi achêk nek palơq nôôq yi, kalóóng tangêi ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Lơq palơq rau huuiq ganơơm achêk, n'loom ahei aku kanóq tơk palơq adhi anó, buôn adhi anó ve nh'jau ve ơơn liêm chu đu bơơr, <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Hayơq tââq dhiq adhi anó buôn vôôiq lalơh tơk Ma-xê-đoan, lơq tââq Ma-xê-đoan vil tơk palơq adhi anó, hayơq bâân adhi anó chalaang vôôiq kalơng tơk Ju-đê. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Taai kơi achêk, xók kanóq ravang tarnêêng ađô, nek ve alua kơq nek aku ơi têêng praaq kalóóng rau kah markơi? Môôiq aku kanóq têêng rau ađêi kanóq lơơi ting manưih ti, buôn hayơq kalóóng aku nek “Alua, alua” palơq “Kah, kah” kơq?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Bơơi Yaang Pleng nek yươq tadhơ, kơi achêk hayơq paraaq ưng nôôq yi đóng leq adhi anó nek eh rau bhêêl “Alua” bhêêl “Kah” mơ. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ơi Akóón Yaang Pleng, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Yaang ơi bâân truuih đuui m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó tââq nôôq yi — hơq nek tââq aku lơq Siin-ven, palơq Ti-mô-thê — eh rau nek bhêêl “alua” bhêêl “kah” hơq kalóóng Ađó biêh taluôn nek “alua”. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ơi n'nal mơ paraaq hươq ưng Yaang Pleng maar nek “alua” kalóóng Ađó. Taai ađek, kung đươi Ađó paraaq “A-meen” tââq nôôq he tapôông leq Yaang Pleng taai cha-iil tabah Ađó. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Mat lââng, Yaang Pleng nek Yaang têêng tavaaih nôôq yi palơq adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq ơi xut dhơu đóng nôôq yi, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Kung nek Yaang ơi teeng kanal nôôq yi lơq đóng rau karnal ưng Yaang Liêm mót kalóóng lóóm nôôq yi.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Hayơq aku nek gavơh nhan Yaang Pleng têêng manưih truuih đuui đóng yaang ravaai aku kơi taai jruôn parngau palơh lơơi đóng adhi anó, aku ơi kah vôôiq leq Kô-rin-tô dyơq. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Eh dhơq tââq nôôq yi ve mataai karơ dhiq lóóm huuiq adhi anó, bơơi tââq nôôq yi nek nôôq parjơơk marau tarnêêng taai bhuui marhaal ưng adhi anó, taai adhi anó ơi dyương mưng kalóóng lóóm huuiq ơi.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Taai aku ơi chamet lêi rau ađô nek liêm đóng chênh ađêi buôn óóq tơk palơq adhi anó machu dyơq kalóóng lóóm kanóq ka-ai ranguôq. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ơi la kala achak aku têêng adhi anó ka-ai ranguôq, hơq ngaai nek manưih têêng đóng aku bhuui marhaal, la eh rau manưih bâân aku têêng đóng ka-ai ranguôq? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Lơq aku ơi xaraq palơq mưi rau nô kơi, buôn lơh xók bhral, aku yươq mơk pâng rau ka-ai ranguôq tââq nôôq manưih hơq đaang nek aku phaai bhuui marhaal, taai ơi patơơt rau huuiq dhiq pabhơt adhi anó kơi rau bhuui ưng aku nek rau bhuui ưng tabhơt adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ơi vaaih gluh tââq garnhuh nhok ranguôq pabhlơng lơq taket luônh lóóm, aku ơi xaraq đóng adhi anó, palơq bơk đơơk mat, eh rau buôn adhi anó bâân ka-ai ranguôq, bơơi nek buôn adhi anó ve chóóm đơơp n'nal lóóm tanhơr hơq aku ve đóng leq adhi anó mưi kơi xưa bhlaai lơh.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Bơơi la ngaai manưih ơi têêng ka-ai ranguôq, nek manưih ađek ơi têêng ka-ai ranguôq eh chapiên đóng aku, hơq dyơq dhiq mưi phơn n'đó ađek, praaq kơi achêk nek buôn aku yươq tagơơn ganưi haleng dhiq pabhơt adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Tanóóm janah achêk đóng leq manưih kơi achêk tââq phơn bơk adhi anó nek dyóp aq, <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />kơi achêk hayơq, palâh lóóiq nek adhi anó kơng lơơi lơt lơq bhơơl pahêêl ađó ađek nek n'jang, e kakhin tơk mơ ađek tôôh, manưih kơi achêk ve chóóm bâân chip klêch kalóóng ka-ai ranguôq kuôq lalơh ưng ađêi. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Kơi achêk hayơq, aku bhơơl pahêêl adhi anó pajal lóóiq kanóq lóóm tanhơr nek palơq manưih ađek. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Alua, aku kung ơi xaraq ơi taai ađôk: buôn aku ve chóóm bâân n'nal palơq kanal lalua dhalam dhiq adhi anó, bơơi adhi anó ve xâng bóóp kalóóng dyóp rau tarnêêng môôiq kah. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Mat lââng, nek palơq manưih hơq adhi anó lơơi lơt mưi rauriq ađek, nek aku kung kơi achêk, ơi chênh tơk aku, nek palơq manưih hơq aku ơi lơơi lơt (la aku ơi lơơi lơt mưi rauriq ađek), achêk nek taai malơơi đóng leq adhi anó dhiq toom mat Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />hơq đóng nôôq he yươq bâân Sa-taan kapươk, ơi eh rau nôôq he kah n'nal rau leq nôôq kanóq mangê ưng ađó.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Bơơi, lơh xók vôôiq tơk Trô-et, lơq dhơ mưi beq palóng đóng Taruuih Liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi bâân yuur lóng đóng aku kalóóng Chuôq, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />bơơi aku ơi kah ve rau hangơơiq hangiil kalóóng lóóm karnóq ađêi, taai aku ơi kah bâân lum Tiit, manưih adhi anó ưng aku. Dhơ kơi ađek, xong xók chap yayar piđó, aku yuur vôôiq tơk Ma-xê-đoan.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Kơi achêk hayơq, ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng, nek Yaang taluôn luôn kađââng nôôq yi vôôiq tóói kơi bâân bhuui yayar kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq tapâng dhiq nôôq yi, yuur pakah n'naq thum leq rau bâân n'nal Ađó tơơt dyóp dhiq. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ơi kơi palơq Yaang Pleng, nôôq yi nek n'naq thum ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih m'pơng nôôq manưih bâân paq lơq m'pơng nôôq manưih hư bil, <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />dhơ nek palơq nôôq manưih ađô, nek n'naq gluh tââq rau chêt buôn malóóm tơk rau chêt, bơơi nek palơq nôôq manưih lââng, nek n'naq thum yuur vaaih tââq rau mamông buôn malóóm tơk rau mamông. Ngaai dyóp praan đóng nôôq rau ađôk? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Ơi nôôq yi kah thê kơi bơk ngaai dhaloong baan paraaq Yaang Pleng taai mayưưm malơơi, bơơi kơi tââq bhơt lóóm dhalam sek chadhah, kơi ngóq tââq Yaang Pleng, nôôq yi truuih đuui toom mat Yaang Pleng kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Ve alua nôôq yi vil tââp tarnââp tư haanh ađêi? Môôiq kơi mưi masôôq manưih, ve kơq nôôq yi kơng thơ chanót achak pagơơi tơk adhi anó hamôôiq tââq adhi anó? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Chênh adhi anó nek tala thơ ưng nôôq yi, ơi bâân xaraq kalóóng lóóm nôôq yi, bâân dyóp ngaai n'nal lơq đok, <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Taai bâân pakah drêh dróói kơi adhi anó nek tala thơ ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, ơi bâân nôôq yi lêi gamang, eh rau bâân xaraq palơq mưk, bơơi palơq Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng taluôn mamông, eh rau dhiq tala dhơl, hơq nek dhiq tala lóóm palơq m'bech. <verse eid="2CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Mat lââng, tââq Chuôq Paq Manưih, nôôq yi ve lóóm huuiq tamưng kơi achêk nek palơq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Eh rau taai nôôq yi ve dyóp praan tââq dhiq kala achak buôn kanóq kơi ngóq mưi tarnêêng n'đó ađek nek ve mayưưm tââq chênh ađêi. Klóóih dhiq ađek, ve đuôh ưng nôôq yi nek tââm tââq Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />nek Yaang kung ơi têêng nôôq yi ve đuôh têêng manưih yaauq ưng raket bóóp tame, eh rau palơq bha-aar xaraq, bơơi nek palơq Yaang Liêm; taai bha-aar xaraq leng chêt, hayơq Yaang Liêm têêng đóng mamông. <verse eid="2CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Mat lââng, la tarnêêng têêng ưng rau chêt, bâân kóóch chan palơq chư dhiq dhơl, ơi bâân yuur pakah kalóóng cha-iil tabah, tơk mơ akóón anaaq I-sơ-ra-êên kah ve đuôh lêi taje leq mat Môôi-se ơi taai cha-iil tabah bâân alaq a-aai ưng mat ađó, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />nek kah alua tarnêêng têêng ưng Yaang Liêm e ve mat kalóóng cha-iil tabah dhaang bơk lơh, n'nal mơ? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ơi la cha-iil tabah dyơq đóng leq tarnêêng têêng ưng tarnêêng patu, nek tarnêêng têêng ưng rau bhơt liêm dhaang bing bhlaai cha-iil tabah bơk lơh dyơq! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Alua, taai rau ơi glêh bâân cha-iil tabah nek kah bâân cha-iil tabah kalóóng tarlum kơi ađôk, ơi taai rau cha-iil tabah yuur yaal lơh. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ơi la rau bâân alaq a-aai ơi tơk palơq cha-iil tabah, nek rau taluôn dyơq e tơk kalóóng cha-iil tabah dhaang bơk lơh bhlơng!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Taai ađek, xók ve lóóm đương rââm kơi achêk, nôôq yi lóng đâh kapươk palơq lóóm lóng nhóól, <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />lơq kah thê kơi Môôi-se, ađó ơi klum mưi tala bhaai dhiq mat ađêi malóóm tơk tarnêêng kah lơơi akóón anaaq I-sơ-ra-êên lêi taje leq chamiit ưng cha-iil tabah bâân alaq a-aai. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Dhơ kơi ađek, lóóm karnóq piđó ơi bâân ka-óng dhơl, ơi đóng patơk tangêi ađôk, mađó mưi tala bhaai achêk bhiêk dyơq tơơt dhiq tarnêêng đok raket bóóp ti, taai kah bâân hayươt lóng, achêk nek tââq kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, ađó hayơq bâân alaq a-aai. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Kơi achêk bơơi, đóng tơk tangêi ađôk, hơq n'đó xók gani Môôi-se bâân đok, nek mưi tala bhaai dhuum leq lóóm piđó. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Hayơq la n'đó xók ngaai ađek palâh malóóm leq Chuôq, nek tala bhaai ađek bâân pei hayươt. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Mat lââng, Chuôq nek Yaang Liêm, lơq Yaang Liêm ưng Chuôq tơơt n'dhiq, nek ve rathaai tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Hayơq pabhơt nôôq he, palơq moh mat kah đơp đơl, dyóól taklaaq cha-iil tabah ưng chuôq, nek xók bâân paxar val kơi mađó mưi a-ô tââq cha-iil tabah tơk cha-iil tabah, dhiêp kơi tââq Chuôq, nek Yaang Liêm.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Ơi taai rau achêk, xók jư tarnêêng ađô, ting kơi n'đơq mơ hơq nôôq yi ơi bâân ka-er kayô, nôôq yi yươq druôi nhưh bhayuih lóóm. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Klóóih leq ađek, nôôq yi ơi kah đươi nôôq rau chóóm kachiit mat kadrêi lââp, xók yươq cha tơơt kalóóng rau kacheel-kachool, kung kah praaq palơt paraaq Yaang Pleng, bơơi nek dhiq tarnêêng truuih đuui paraaq dhalam, tư paliêm paraaq chênh ađêi đóng lóóm karnóq dyóp ngaai toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Bơơi patơk mơ la Taruuih Liêm ưng nôôq yi ve bâân pađơp pađơl, hơq achêk nek ơi bâân pađơp pađơl dhiq m'pơng nôôq manưih hư bil, <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />hơq m'pơng kalóóng kabhuh piđó, yaang đơơi ađôk ơi têêng bhơơm lóóm karnóq ưng nôôq manưih kah huuiq ađek, tơk mơ taklaaq brương taruuih liêm cha-iil tabah ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, Yaang nek a-ô ưng Yaang Pleng, kah klaaq dyóól dhiq piđó. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ơi nôôq yi kah truuih đuui chênh ađêi, bơơi nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq nek Chuôq, hayơq kala achak nôôq yi kơi nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng adhi anó ơi taai Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Tââq Yaang Pleng, Yaang ơi praaq: “Taklaaq brương e klaaq dyóól tââq kalóóng bóng kanam,” nek Yaang ơi klaaq dyóól kalóóng lóóm nôôq yi malóóm tơk tarnêêng têêng tabrương rau lêi n'nal leq cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng dhiq mat Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Bơơi nôôq yi kađôôq karvaan akiiq ađô kalóóng nôôq beq ajraai katiêk aliêng, buôn kataai gamak jalơh lơh ưng mataai karơ achêk nek tââq Yaang Pleng, eh rau tââq nôôq yi. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Nek nôôq manưih đơơp gariêq kaxiêq kalóóng dyóp tââq, bơơi yươq bâân dhur lóóm; bâân karaang kakhin, bơơi yươq bil lóóm rââm; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />bâân chanaaq janah, bơơi yươq bâân m'peq lơơi; bâân kóóp m'poh, bơơi yươq chêt bil; <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />taluôn đââng kalóóng achak araang ađêi akan chêt ưng Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq plok dyóp dhiq, buôn parmông ưng Chuôq Jê-su kung ve chóóm bâân tapakah kalóóng achak araang nôôq yi; <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />ơi dhơ xók mamông, nôôq yi taluôn bâân pajaau đóng rau akan chêt ơi taai Chuôq Jê-su, buôn parmông ưng Chuôq Jê-su kung bâân tapakah kalóóng dyaang achak ting xâng akan chêt ưng nôôq yi. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Kơi achêk, akan chêt veq matêêng kalóóng nôôq yi, hayơq rau parmông nek tơơt kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Bơơi xók ve mađó mưi lóóm kanóq ưng lóóm huuiq ting paraaq ơi xaraq: “Aku huuiq, hayơq aku praaq”. Nôôq yi kung huuiq, hayơq nôôq yi kung praaq, <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />taai n'nal kơi Yaang ơi têêng Chuôq Jê-su mamông lóóiq kung e têêng nôôq yi mamông lóóiq palơq Chuôq Jê-su, lơq e pakah mat nôôq yi nek palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Alua, dyóp tarnêêng ađek nek ơi taai adhi anó, buôn ơơn phươk liêm, xong xók vaaih bơk dhiq bơk manưih lơh, ve chóóm têêng rau ma-ơơn tơk mơ xưa raai đóng leq cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Kơi achêk, nôôq yi yươq nhưh nhok bil lóóm. Dhơ kơi ađek, patơk mơ la manưih hót nguôi ưng nôôq yi xók bâân óóch xaraam, kơi achêk bơơi manưih hót kalóóng ưng nôôq yi dyơq bâân têêng tame ting dyóp tangêi. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ơi bhrê hư m'bưưiq hangiil xók bhêêl ađek ưng nôôq yi ơi đââng lóóiq đóng nôôq yi parbơk cha-iil tabah tơk nh'chró, kah magađơq, kah lơq marchơng đuôh. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Xók nôôq yi kah chamet lóóm lêi nôôq rau chóóm lêi, bơơi nek nôôq rau kah chóóm lêi. Taai nôôq rau chóóm lêi nek maxưưiq giêl, hayơq nôôq rau kah chóóm lêi nek taluôn luôn.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Taai nôôq he n'nal kơi la dhanong đong dhiq katiêk ưng nôôq he, hơq nek ưng pơơq pađơ ađôk, bâân rơh pahư, nek nôôq he ve mưi tarnêêng yuur têêng gluh tââq Yaang Pleng, nek đong tơk nh'chró dhiq nôôq klaang pleng, eh tââq têi manưih he yuur têêng. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Lơq alua, nôôq he xaxih kagôh kalóóng dhanong đong ađô, dyơq xók đương rââm bâân xơp kơơq leq dhiq dham tơơt ưng ađêi tââq dhiq pleng, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />lơq bhơt m'bưưiq la nek ơi xơp, nôôq he e yươq bâân lêi nek lalôh lalut. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Lơq alua, nek nôôq manưih xók tơơt kalóóng pơơq pađơ ađô, nôôq he xaxih kagôh taai đơơp nhưh nhok, ơi taai rau ađek hơq nôôq he kah kiêng bâân lôh xalun, bơơi bâân ng'guôk thêêm kơơq, buôn nôôq ting xâng rau akan chêt ve chóóm bâân galuôn tabil tââq rau mamông. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Mat lââng, Yaang ơi ravang nôôq he đóng chênh rau ađô nek Yaang Pleng, nek Yaang ơi đóng leq nôôq he rau karnal ưng Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Taai ađek, dhơ taluôn luôn nhóól lóóm nek biêh n'nal kơi xók tơơt kalóóng đong dyaang achak ađô, nôôq he xók changaai tââq Chuôq, <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />ơi nôôq he bhadyaang vôôiq tââq lóóm huuiq, eh tââq mat chóóm lêi. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Hayơq nôôq yi bhiêk nhóól lóóm lơq bhuui lóóm nh'jang changaai tââq dyaang achak ađô lơq tơơt đong palơq Chuôq nek lơh. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Đóng hayơq nôôq yi bhơt lóóm tabhlơng buôn bâân bhuui lóóm Chuôq, dhơ nek tơơt kalóóng đong môôiq changaai bhlưa. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ơi rau pa-eep nek palơq tabhơt nôôq he nek phaai bâân gluh pakah toom tanơơt praaq xêi ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq đóng ting chanak ve chóóm đơơp lóóiq nôôq rau ađaang glap palơq nôôq tarnêêng hơq ađêi ơi têêng tapâng dhiq dyaang achak, ve nh'jau nek liêm môôiq môôp.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Taai ađek, ơi n'nal rau ađaang bhi kakhin ưng Chuôq, nôôq yi praaq pakah đóng palââng. Hayơq nôôq yi bâân Yaang Pleng n'nal drêh, hơq aku kung rââm lóóm bâân n'nal drêh kalóóng lóóm karnóq ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Eh rau nôôq yi vil xók tư pakah ađêi kala palơq adhi anó, bơơi nek xók đóng adhi anó mưi kapươk tarhơơnh ơi taai nôôq yi, buôn adhi anó ve chóóm ve paraaq tar-ââi đóng leq nôôq manưih laach jơơr dhiq parliêm hót nguôi hơq eh rau kalóóng lóóm. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ơi la nôôq yi ve vaaih xươl, achêk nek taai Yaang Pleng; la nôôq yi ve chagơn kajơq, achêk nek taai adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Tââq lóóm nh'nhơr ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih pa-eep nôôq yi, xong xók chamet lêi rau ađô: ađek nek mưi chanak ơi chêt klóóih đóng dyóp ngaai; đóng hayơq, dyóp ngaai ơi chêt. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Ađó ơi chêt klóóih đóng dyóp ngaai, buôn nôôq ngaai xók mamông kah dyơq mamông taai chênh ađêi dyơq, bơơi nek taai Yaang ơi chêt klóóih piđó lơq ơi bâân têêng mamông lóóiq. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Kơi achêk hayơq, tââq xók ađôk, nôôq yi kah dyơq n'nal ngaai ting manưih ti. Patơk mơ dhơ nôôq yi ơi glêh đơơp n'nal Chuôq Paq Manưih ting manưih ti, bơơi bhêêl ađôk, nôôq yi kah dyơq đơơp n'nal Ađó ting kơi achêk dyơq. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Kơi achêk, la ngaai tơơt kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih hơq nek mưi manưih vaaih tame. Nôôq rau ti ơi lơh bil; lêi tôôh, nôôq rau tame ơi vaaih bhral. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Dhơ kơi ađek, pabhơt nôôq rau ađô gluh tââq Yaang Pleng, nek Yaang ơi paliêm lóóiq nôôq he palơq chênh Ađó đươi Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq ơi pajaau đóng nôôq he tarnêêng têêng paliêm lóóiq ađô, <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />kơi ngóq nek Yaang Pleng tơơt kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, xók paliêm lóóiq akóón manưih hóng katiêk palơq Ađó, kah yaap xêi nôôq matu lơt ưng piđó huông palơq piđó, lơq ơi patơơt lơơi kalóóng nôôq he taruuih paliêm lóóiq achêk.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Taai ađek, nôôq yi nek nôôq manưih xal mat Chuôq Paq Manưih, kơi ngóq Yaang Pleng xók dhaloong tađaang tapâng dhiq nôôq yi: nôôq yi mââl nhan xal mat Chuôq Paq Manưih: “Phaai bâân paliêm lóóiq palơq Yaang Pleng!” <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Ađó ơi têêng Yaang ơi kah bâân n'nal matu lơt val kơi matu lơt klóóih đóng nôôq he, buôn nôôq he chóóm val kơi rau bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng kalóóng Yaang achêk.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Mat lââng, dyơq xók têêng tarnêêng palơq Ađó, nôôq yi kung mââl nhan adhi anó óóq đơơp ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng kơi kah malơơi — <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ơi Ađó praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Xók bhêêl bâân ââi, Aku ơi tameng xâng buôn ââi lóóiq akóón,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">lơq kalóóng tangêi paq jóói, Aku ơi poor jóói akóón.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">“Tôôh, xók ađôk nek bhêêl bhuui ââi. Tôôh, xók ađôk nek tangêi paq jóói.” —<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />palơq nek kah têêng tavaaih kơi lơt môôp kalóóng bhơt dhơ dharau, buôn tarnêêng têêng ưng nôôq yi yươq bâân xuôq trêh. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Klóóih dhiq ađek, kalóóng dyóp rau, nôôq yi pakah ađêi kala kơi nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng: kalóóng rau đơơp juôn lóng gamak, kalóóng bơk bhrê hư, kalóóng bơk paraaq kalơng kariing, kalóóng vaaih kadhaap jarnah, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />kalóóng nôôq gamuôn tanaach, kalóóng dhiq đong kanam, kalóóng dhiq nhôôn nhaauq, kalóóng tarlum kadhaap nhok, kalóóng nôôq hayum bil bêch, kalóóng nôôq ganhuh tabhuch ha-ul, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />kalóóng rau tabah sek, kalóóng rau tarbech n'nal, kalóóng rau jruôn parngau, kalóóng rau moor dha-iiq, kalóóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm, kalóóng lóóm tanhơr drêh lóóm; <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />klóóng paraaq pâng dhalam, kalóóng mataai karơ ưng Yaang Pleng; đươi nôôq dhaau bhươt mamông liêm dhiq têi atươm lơq têi ađaai, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />tââq tarhơơnh lơq kađiq kachiit, tââq tanđôôr môôp palơq tanđôôr liêm; kơi manưih galơơk chachââr, hơq vil ađaang huuiq ganơơm; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />kơi kah bâân tơk n'nal, hơq vil bâân bơk ngaai đơơp n'nal; kơi đan chêt, hơq — tôôh! — dyơq mamông; kơi đơơp kóóp jarnah, hơq vil yươq bâân leng chêt; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />kơi đơơp ranguôq jarnah, bơơi taluôn bhuui marhaal; kơi ngeeo ha-ul, bơơi têêng đóng bơk ngaai val kơi karvaan; kơi kah ve rau, hơq vil bâân đươi dyóp rau.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Adhi anó manưih Kô-rin-tô ơơi, bóóp nôôq yi ơi yuur pơơh nek palơq adhi anó; lóóm nôôq yi ơi bâân lương tabhươh. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Eh rau adhi anó bâân hiin châq tââq nôôq yi, bơơi adhi anó bâân hiin châq tââq lóóm ađêi. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Kơi achêk hayơq, kalóóng rau chróót ơơn đóng ađaang, aku praaq kơi ngóq palơq akóón paniên, adhi anó kung phaai lơơi chênh ađêi bâân talương tabhươh.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Óóq đơơp bak et kah glap palơq manưih kah huuiq. Ơi rau bhơt liêm lơq kah magani ve rau chóóm mưi mađó? Môôiq kalaaq brương palơq bóng kanam ve n'đó rau pajoop madhiq? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq Bê-li-aan ve rau chóóm mađó madhiq? Môôiq manưih huuiq ve rau phơn madhiq palơq manưih kah huuiq? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng nek palơq yaang kabhêi ve rau chóóm mađó? Ơi nôôq he nek đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng taluôn mamông, dhiêp kơi Yaang Pleng ve praaq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">“Aku e tơơt jaq lơq vôôiq val dhiq m'pơng piđó;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Aku e nek Yaang Pleng ưng piđó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">lơq chênh piđó e nek dhanuôr Aku.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Kơi achêk hayơq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“Phaai vôôiq gluh tââq m'pơng kabhuh piđó</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">lơq đơơp tablah palơq piđó,” Chuôq praaq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“lơq óóq drơơn tơk rau đu anhuq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">hayơq Aku e pơh đơơp nôôq akóón.”<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Lơq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">“‘Aku e nek Ama nek palơq nôôq akóón,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">lơq nôôq akóón e nek akóón padruuih, akóón pađiil nek palơq Aku,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Chuôq Bhơt Mataai praaq.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Taai ađek, nhan móón adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr, taai bâân pakala nôôq paraaq hươq achêk, nôôq he phaai têêng pasek chênh ađêi lơh dyóp rau dham anhuq ưng dyaang achak lơq lóóm yaang, xók têêng rau sek tabah hayơq bhơt liêm dhiq rau bhi kakhin Yaang pleng.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Phaai pơơh lóóm đóng nôôq yi! Nôôq yi ơi yươq glêh tabhrê karchêt mưi ngaai; nôôq yi ơi yươq glêh têêng bil lóóm mưi ngaai; nôôq yi ơi yươq kapươk malua mưi ngaai. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Aku kah praaq buôn malóóm tơk tarnêêng patu adhi anó; taai aku ơi glêh praaq loom kơi adhi anó tơơt kalóóng lóóm nôôq yi, buôn chêt palơq xóng ađêi, lơq mamông palơq xóng ađêi. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Rau huuiq ganơơm ưng aku dhiq adhi anó nek bơk; rau đu tarhơơnh ưng aku leq adhi anó nek gamak. Aku ơi bâân xưa raai rau bhơơl pahêêl. Aku bâân xưa bơk bhuui marhaal ađô kalóóng dyóp rau bhrê hư ưng nôôq yi.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ơi kah xêi xong xók aku vôôiq tơk Ma-xê-đoan, achak araang nôôq yi ơi kah ve bâân dhêi drơq m'bưưiq m'bâ, bơơi bâân kadhaap nhok kalóóng dyóp hót, bơk tarjeng tarjơl hót nguôi, kakhin kapơn hót kalóóng. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Dhơ kơi ađek. Yaang Pleng, Yaang bhơơl pahêêl nôôq ngaai bhayuih lóóm, ơi bhơơl pahêêl nôôq yi palơh tarnêêng Tiit vôôiq tơk ađô, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />hơq kah mưi tââq tarnêêng tơk ađô ưng ađó achêk, bơơi hayơq tââq rau pahêêl lóóm hơq ađó achêk ơi bâân bhơơl pahêêl tơơt dhiq adhi anó, xók truuih đóng nôôq yi leq lóóm rââm lêi ưng adhi anó, rau nhiim gavơh ưng adhi anó, lóóm jêi tarang ưng adhi anó ơi taai aku, đóng patơk mơ aku dhaang bâân bhuui marhaal lơh dyơq.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Taai patơk mơ la aku têêng đóng adhi anó ranguôq kalóóng thơ, nek aku kah châq mơ. Patơk mơ la aku biêh châq (aku lêi kơi tala thơ ađek ơi têêng adhi anó ranguôq, dhơ chapiên kalóóng maxưưiq giêl), <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />nek xók ađôk, aku bhuui marhaal, eh rau taai adhi anó ơi bâân ranguôq lóóm, bơơi tââq adhi anó ơi bâân ranguôq lóóm hơq malóóm tơk rau klôôq lóóm. Taai adhi anó ơi bâân ranguôq lóóm ting Yaang Pleng, hơq đóng adhi anó ve nh'jau kah đơơp hư mahaai kalóóng bhơt dhơ dharau tââq dhiq nôôq yi. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Tââq rau ka-ai ranguôq ting Yaang Pleng têêng vaaih rau klôôq lóóm hơq malóóm tơk rau paq jóói hơq yươq rau châq; bơơi yuur ka-ai ranguôq ưng manưih hóng katiêk nek đââng lóóiq akan chêt. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Ơi lêi tôôh, palơq rau tarnêêng ađek, xók bâân têêng đóng ka-ai ranguôq ting Yaang Pleng, nek ơi đââng lóóiq kalóóng adhi anó lóóm jêi tarang bơk kah mơ móón: dyơq ve rau paq ađêi ng'kơi, rau yuur pagrâ ng'kơi, rau bhi kakhin ng'kơi, lóóm đương rââm n'đó kơi, lóóm puih kadrók n'đó kơi, tarnêêng praaq teng n'đó kơi! Kalóóng dyóp rau, adhi anó ơi pakah lêi ađêi nek tabah sek leq bhiêk tarnêêng ađô. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Kơi achêk hayơq, patơk mơ dhơ aku ơi xaraq đóng adhi anó, nek eh rau ơi taai manưih ơi têêng praaq môôp lơt, môôiq ơi taai manưih ơi bâân têêng mahaai, bơơi nek ơi taai lóóm jêi tarang ưng adhi anó, hơq nek rau xal mat nôôq yi, ơi bâân tapakah đóng adhi anó toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Đươi rau ađô, nôôq yi bâân pahêêl lóóm.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Mat lââng, nek palơq rau pahêêl lóóm ưng chênh ađêi, nôôq yi ơi dhaang bâân bhuui yayar bơk lơh dhiq rau bhuui ưng Tiit, taai lóóm karnóq ưng ađó achêk ơi bâân têêng đóng khe rathaai tââq pabhơt adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ơi la aku glêh pajơơr ve rau palơq ađó achêk leq adhi anó, nek aku ơi yươq kachiit mat, bơơi kơi dyóp rau nôôq yi ơi praaq palơq adhi anó kalóóng rau dhalam lalua, nek paraaq yuur pajơơr ưng nôôq yi kung ơi bâân pakah rau dhalam lalua kơi achêk nek palơq Tiit. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Lơq lóóm nh'nhơr ưng ađó achêk đóng leq adhi anó nek xưa raai lơh dyơq, xók hei lóóiq rau xâng bóóp ưng pabhơt adhi anó, n'đó kơi hơq adhi anó ơi pơh yaauq ađó achêk palơq rau kakhin kapơn lơq hayer hatơq. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Aku bhuui marhaal taai aku huuiq ganơơm dhiq adhi anó kalóóng dyóp rau tarnêêng.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Nhan móón adhi anó, nôôq yi pakah đóng adhi anó n'nal leq ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng ơi bâân đóng leq m'pơng kalóóng nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq Ma-xê-đoan, <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />achêk nek kalóóng ganơt klêêu klôôq haleng haluq ưng rau kóóp róp, rau bhuui xưa raai ưng piđó lơq rau ngeeo kadhaap markơi jarnah ưng piđó ơi bhlaai bing xar rau kabhôôq karvaan ưng lóóm bhươh rông ađêi. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ơi aku truuih đuui kơi piđó ơi tapôông đóng ting mơ ve đuôh, patơk mơ bơk lơh mơ ađêi ve, tââq lóóm ađêi kiêng, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />nek palơq bơk paraaq gavơh nhan, xók pa-eep mââl nôôq yi đóng bâân ve ơơn lơq rau tapâng phơn kalóóng tarnêêng têêng yaauq ađô đóng leq nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Lơq kah mơ ting kơi nôôq yi ơi đương rââm, bơơi laloom bhơt piđó ơi tapôông đóng chênh ađêi đóng Chuôq, hayơq đóng nôôq yi, đươi leq kanóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ting ađek, nôôq yi bhơơl chut Tiit, đóng ađó achêk ơi tââp têêng n'đó kơi, nek kiêng markơi, ađó achêk kung ve nh'jau paxong tarnêêng nh'nhơr manưih achêk đóng adhi anó kơi achêk. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Dhơ kơi ađek, kơi adhi anó jalơh m'piing kalóóng dyóp rau, leq lóóm huuiq, paraaq praaq, rau tabech n'nal, lóóm jêi tarang bhơt lóóm, lơq lóóm tanhơr tââq dhiq nôôq yi tơơt kalóóng adhi anó, hơq đóng adhi anó kung kơng jalơh m'piing kalóóng tarnêêng nh'nhơr manưih ađô. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Eh rau aku praaq ting kơi paraaq râng, bơơi nek tapâng lóóm jêi tarang ưng nôôq manưih lââng, buôn lêi rau lalua dhalam leq lóóm tanhơr ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Taai adhi anó bâân n'nal ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, achêk nek ơi taai adhi anó, dhơ nek kabhôôq karvaan, Ađó ơi val xar ngeeo ha-ul, hơq đóng đươi rau kadhaap jarnah ưng Yaang achêk, adhi anó val xar karvaan kabhôôq.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Lơq aku yuur pakah kanóq paraaq leq tarnêêng ađô, taai rau ađô đââng lóóiq malơơi đóng adhi anó, nek nôôq manưih eh mơ ơi yuur ravang têêng tarnêêng ađô tââq mưi kamó laloom, hơq hayơq rââm kiêng têêng dyơq. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Hayơq xók ađôk, adhi anó kung phaai paxong bhơt tarnêêng ơi yuur têêng, ng'kơi đóng rau ravang lóóm yuur têêng kanóq kiêng n'đó kơi, nek rau paxong tââq dhiq đuôh praan xók ve kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ơi la rau ravang lóóm ve laloom ơi, nek đô-đaak tapôông bâân bhuui đơơp ting mơ rau hơq bhiêk nek ađêi ve, eh alua ting rau hơq ađêi kah ve.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Alua, eh rau buôn rau khe rathaai nek đóng leq manưih lââng, hayơq vaaih kadhaap nhok nek đóng leq adhi anó, bơơi nek ting kơi marmơ marđơq. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Mót ganah xók ađek, rau xưa raai ưng adhi anó đóng leq tarlum tabhuch hat ưng nôôq manưih achêk, buôn rau xưa raai ưng nôôq manưih achêk kung ve chóóm nek đóng leq rau kiêng ưng adhi anó, ng'kơi đóng ve rau marmơ marđơq, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />dhiêp kơi ơi xaraq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">“Manưih ve bơk kah xưa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">manưih ve m'bưưiq kung yươq tabhuch.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Bơơi ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng, Yaang patơơt palơq mưi rau jêi tarang leq adhi anó mót leq lóóm Tiit. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ơi ađó achêk dhơ nek ơi đơơp đươi paraaq panhel nhan ưng nôôq yi, bơơi taai ve lóóm lóng jêi tarang, ađó achêk ơi tư ađêi tơk palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Mat lââng, nôôq yi ơi kayua mưi chanak adhi anó ting vôôiq maleq palơq ađó achêk, hơq dhariêng babóóch haanh ưng manưih ađô kalóóng Taruuih Liêm đââr plok pabhơt nôôq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq; <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />hơq kah mơ kơi achêk, bơơi kung taai ơi bâân chââih lưa tââq nôôq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq kơi parjơơk marau tarnêêng ưng nôôq yi, nek palơq tarnêêng nh'nhơr manưih ađô, nek tarnêêng xók dyơq nôôq yi kadhâng lêi malóóm tơk cha-iil tabah ưng Chuôq, lơq pakah rau ravang lóóm ưng ađêi; <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />xók jư ve magađơq kơi achêk, kah ngaai ve chóóm chê teng nôôq yi leq jêên lóóm thươr xók bâân nôôq yi kadhâng lêi ađô. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Taai nôôq yi chamet lêi loom leq nôôq rau dhalam liêm, eh mơ toom mat Chuôq, hơq dyơq toom mat akóón manưih.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Lơh tââq ađek, nôôq yi ơi kayua mưi chanak adhi anó ưng nôôq yi ting vôôiq palơq piđó, achêk nek manưih hơq nôôq yi ơi buôn lêi dhiq bơk hót, taai biêh ve lóóm jêi tarang, hơq xók ađôk dhaang jêi tarang lơh đươi lóóm huuiq ganơơm gamak dhiq adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />La nek leq Tiit, ađó achêk nek manưih ting poor tarnêêng ưng aku lơq parjơơk marau tarnêêng nek palơq adhi anó. Hơq la nôôq adhi anó tôôh ưng nôôq yi, piđó nek nôôq manưih đââng paraaq ưng nôôq Akóón Adhơn Chuôq, nek cha-iil tabah Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Taai ađek, xók têêng pakah palơq piđó pakah lêi lóóm tanhơr ưng adhi anó lơq paraaq pajơơr ưng nôôq yi leq adhi anó nek têêng pakah toom mat nôôq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Leq tarnêêng têêng yaauq đóng leq nôôq manưih huuiq, hơq ađô nek chiên xưa raai buôn aku phaai xaraq đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ơi aku n'nal rau ravang lóóm ưng adhi anó, nek rau hơq aku xal mat adhi anó palơq nôôq đu huuiq Chuôq dhiq Ma-xê-đoan kơi, akóón dhơn Chuôq dhiq A-chaai ơi ravang lơơi tââq mưi kamó loom, lơq lóóm rââm kiêng ưng adhi anó ơi bhơơl chut bơk ngaai lơh. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Bơơi aku ơi kayua nôôq adhi anó tôôh, buôn paraaq pajơơr ưng nôôq yi leq adhi anó yươq bâân aluôt luh-luông kalóóng nôôq rau ađô, hơq đóng adhi anó ve chóóm ravang lơơi kơi aku ơi praaq. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />La kah, la bơơr pe nak adhi anó đu huuiq dhiq Ma-xê-đoan ve chóóm vôôiq palơq aku lơq lêi rau kah ravang lơơi dhiq adhi anó, nek nôôq yi bâân kachiit mat, achêk nek kah ơi praaq tơk adhi anó, tââq rau grâ lóóm ađek ưng nôôq yi. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Đóng hayơq aku ơi kanóq kayua chut nôôq adhi anó ađek nek tarnêêng kơng bhlơng, hơq đóng piđó ve chóóm vôôiq loom palơq adhi anó lơq ravang lơơi kaliim kliim ơi hươq ađô ưng adhi anó, buôn ve rau ravang lơơi ting kơi ađek kơi mưi phươk liêm, hơq óóq kơi tarnêêng pa-eep.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Mat lââng, aku praaq rau ađô: ngaai chóói kơi kuôq kaniêq nek e xóót kơi kaniêq, lơq ngaai chóói dhiq nôôq phươk liêm nek e xóót dhiq nôôq phươk liêm. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Ting chanak tapôông đóng ting kơi ađêi ơi kanóq loom kalóóng lóóm, kah yuur vaaih tââq rau ranguôq lóóm môôiq tââq rau pa-eep raan, Ơi Yaang Pleng nh'nhơr manưih bhuui lóóm tapôông đóng. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Hayơq Yaang Pleng ve kataai têêng dyóp ơơn phươk xưa raai dhiq adhi anó, buôn taluôn luôn kalóóng dyóp rau, taai ve dyóp bhơt rau kơng đươi, adhi anó ve chóóm xưa raai kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng liêm. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kơi ve xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Ngaai xaraai karvaan poor jóói, ngaai pađơơp nh'xóóng đóng manưih ngeeo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">nek rau bhơt liêm ađó dyơq lóóiq đóng patơk nh'chró.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Mat lââng, Yaang blah đóng kaliêng m'ma leq manưih chóói lơq beng buôn têêng tarmông e pei đóng kơi xưa raai, e têêng kaliêng m'ma ưng adhi anó grơơt lơh, lơq e têêng nôôq pô pale ưng rau bhơt liêm dhiq adhi anó bơk lơh, <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />xók bâân xưa raai kalóóng bhơt dyóp rau buôn bhơt lóóm bhươh rông, nek rau đââng tơk paraaq ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng tââq nôôq he, <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />taai tarnêêng têêng yaauq ađô eh mơ nek ngi đóng padyóp nôôq rau kiêng ưng nôôq manưih huuiq liêm, hơq dyơq têêng đóng xưa bhlaai palơq bơk paraaq ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />xók bhi haanh Yaang Pleng đươi rau ngi lêi ưng tarnêêng ađô ganơơm dhiq rau đơơp huuiq dhiq paraaq yuur praaq ưng adhi anó nek palơq taruuih liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq lóóm bhươh rông kalóóng mađó madhiq đóng leq piđó lơq đóng dyóp ngaai, <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />palơq kalóóng paraaq gavơh nhan ưng piđó leq adhi anó, lóóm nh'nhơr đương rââm adhi anó taai ơơn phươk liêm bhươh yaal ưng Yaang Pleng dhiq adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Rau ma-ơơn tapôông leq Yaang Pleng taai kaliim kliim kah n'nal mơ móón ưng Ađó!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Chênh ađêi aku, Phaau-lô, nek manưih dhơ moor dha-iiq xók taje mat dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, bơơi vil grâ nhóól palơq adhi anó xók kah ve mat, mââl bhơơl adhi anó palơq rau moor m'pheep lơq matư ma-iiq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Aku gavơh nhan kơi, xók ve mat, nek aku e kah kơng grâ lóóm palơq rau kah dhơ paraaq hơq aku xók kanóq nek phaai têêng karơ têi huông palơq bơơr pe chanak đóng kơi nôôq yi kơi ngóq xók jađaang vôôiq ting manưih ti. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ơi dhơ mamông kalóóng ng'kar m'bech, bơơi nôôq yi kah tarjơl ting ng'kar m'bech. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Tââq nôôq kóóih bhươt tarleng tarjơl ưng nôôq yi eh alua nek ng'kar m'bech, hơq nek mataai karơ kalóóng Yaang Pleng đóng leq tarnêêng têêng pahư nôôq đong linh têêng tabil nôôq paraaq kacheel kachool <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />palơq dyóp rau laach jơơr yuur vaaih huông lóóiq rau n'nal leq Yaang Pleng, lơq pa-eep dyóp karnóq taval leq rau xâng bóóp Chuôq Paq Manưih; <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />lơq ve lóóm ravang lơơi buôn têêng dyóp rau paraaq tarnêêng kah xâng bóóp phaai chróót charóót, xók rau xâng bóóp ưng adhi anó ơi bâân kre liêm.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Adhi anó xók lêi rau tarnêêng tơơt dhiq mat nguôi. La ngaai huuiq mưng dhiq kala achak kơi ađêi mađó leq Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek manưih ađek phaai kanóq chamet lóóiq rau ađô leq chênh ađêi, kơi ađô: manưih ađek mađó leq Chuôq Paq Manưih n'đó kơi nek nôôq yi kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ơi patơk mơ la aku ve pajơơr hau rau kuôq lalơh leq karơ kataai ưng ađêi, nek karơ kataai Chuôq ơi pajaau đóng leq tarnêêng têêng tahayuur hơq eh rau đóng tarnêêng têêng pahư adhi anó, aku e yươq rau kachiit mat, <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />buôn aku yươq têêng ađêi kơi ngóq têêng adhi anó phaai kakhin kapơn palơq thơ xaraq ưng ađêi. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ơi taai ve ngaai móón: “Dhơ nôôq tala thơ ưng ađó ađek râng paraaq lơq karơ bóóp, Bơơi xók ve mat palơq ng'haang palơq m'bech dhiq ađô nek dhuur lóóm, lơq bóóp paraaq yươq rauriq.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Manưih kơi achêk phaai kanóq chamet rau ađô, xók kah ve mat nôôq yi nek n'đó kơi kalóóng paraaq praaq dhiq nôôq tala thơ, nek xók ve mat têêng vôôiq ưng nôôq yi kung kơi achêk.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ơi nôôq yi kah khin xađơng môôiq marchơng ađêi palơq bơơr pe chanak tư payaal ađêi kala. Bơơi nôôq manưih achêk, xók đang bang piđó dhiq chênh piđó, lơq tư marchơng kala achak palơq chênh ađêi, nek kah n'nal rarau. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Palâh lóóiq, nôôq yi e kah pajơơr leq nôôq rau kuôq lơh xưa, bơơi nek ting mơ dhanang kalóóng mơ dhiq hơq Yaang Pleng ơi blah nh'xóóng đóng nôôq yi, mưi mơ dhanang ơi chavó tơk dhiq adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Tââq nôôq yi eh rau xók tư jalơh xưa mơ garóóng, kơi xók kah glêh chavó tơk adhi anó, ơi patơk mơ, nôôq yi ơi vôôiq loom tơk dhiq adhi anó palơq Truuih Liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />kah pajơơr leq nôôq rau lơh kanóóng bhlưa dhiq nôôq kông galeh ưng nôôq manưih lââng, bơơi taai ve rau lóóm rââm dhiq adhi anó, xók lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó bâân grơơt lơh, buôn nôôq kông galeh ting mơ kalóóng ưng nôôq yi bâân tabhươh gamak tơk mơ xưa raai, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />buôn truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm dhiq nôôq parah bhlưa changaai adhi anó, yươq phaai pajơơr leq nôôq rau ơi bâân pasam lơơi dhiq mơ kalóóng ưng manưih lââng.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />“Bơơi ngaai pajơơr ađêi, phaai pajơơr ađêi kalóóng Chuôq.”<verse eid="2CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ơi eh rau manưih tư bhi haanh chênh ađêi nek manưih ađek ve rau chóóm đươi, bơơi nek manưih hơq Chuôq bhi haanh.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Rââm kiêng adhi anó biêh ơi đơơp jruôn mưi m'bưưiq ngôôk xươl ưng aku, dhơ kơi ađek adhi anó ađôk xók đơơp jruôn aku! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ơi aku tatrô kabhróónh leq adhi anó, palơq lóóm tatrô ưng Yaang Pleng, taai aku ơi pajum adhi anó đóng mưi kayiik, đóng pakah adhi anó kơi mưi pađiil kamór liêm bhóók đóng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Bơơi aku karaang kapơn, kakhin e ting kơi kiq ađek, kơi panong kaxênh ơi dharơơl galơơk Ê-va palơq rau galơơk palơt ưng ađó, nek lóóm karnóq adhi anó ve nh'jau bâân dhuur tarbhlêh changaai bhlưa lóóm pâng dhalam lơq sek chadhah đóng leq Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ơi la ngaai ađek tơk truuih móón mưi Jê-su lââng hơq nôôq yi ơi kah truuih pachóóm, môôiq adhi anó đơơp mưi yaang lââng, eh rau Yaang adhi anó ơi đơơp, môôiq mưi Taruuih Liêm lââng hơq adhi anó ơi kah pei đơơp, nek adhi anó khe buôn đơơp jruôn!<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Hayơq aku chamet lêi ađêi kah ve rau thua parneq nôôq “sưưq-đô tabech kataai” tôôh. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Bơơi patơk mơ dhơ nek kah rabeh-rabel kalóóng tarnêêng truuih pachóóm, kơi achêk bơơi eh rau nek rabeh-rabel leq tarbech, hơq kalóóng ting rau tarnêêng ơi pakah giit đóng adhi anó kalóóng dyóp kơi. <verse eid="2CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Môôiq ve kơq aku têêng matu, xók pa-êêp ađêi chok leq buôn adhi anó ve chóóm bâân chap payaal, ơi taai aku ơi truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng kơi kah majêên đóng adhi anó? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Aku ơi pei đơơp nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq lââng, xók ơi đơơp jêên ưng piđó buôn đóng leq tarnêêng têêng yaauq adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Xók tơơt palơq adhi anó, dhơ đơơp ngeeo ha-ul, aku ơi yươq têêng ganưi haleng đóng dhơ dhangaai. Taai lơh xók vôôiq tơk ađô, nôôq adhi anó tââq Ma-xê-đoan ơi poor đóng bhơt rau kơng ưng aku, lơq kalóóng dyóp rau tarnêêng, aku ơi jư lơq e dyơq bhiêk jư kala achak eh rau nek ganưi haleng đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Paraaq dhalam ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt kalóóng aku, kơi achêk hayơq rau tarhơơnh ađô leq kala achak e yươq bâân takajơq dhiq nôôq parah xưưq ưng A-chaai. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Taai hau rau? Taai aku kah nh'nhơr adhi anó alua? Yaang Pleng n'nal aku ve.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Hayơq rau aku xók têêng, nek aku kung e bhiêk dyơq têêng, buôn aku ve chóóm pei lơơi mangê kapươk ưng nôôq manưih rââm kiêng ting kapươk kơi đóng kalóóng tarnêêng hơq piđó xók pajơơr, piđó kung ve chóóm bâân haliq lêi thê kơi nôôq yi. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Ơi nôôq manưih kơi achêk nek nôôq sưưq-đô galơơk, kabhuh têêng makông galơơk chachââr, xók têêng achak xar sưưq-đô ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ve chrih laaq rauriq, ơi kala achak Sa-taan paxar achak xar dhơn pleng brương braang. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Đóng hayơq kah ve harau gamak chrih la nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng ađó kung paxar achak kơi nôôq dhơn ratơơq bhơt liêm, hơq xariêq ưng kabhuh piđó ađek nek e glap ađaang palơq nôôq tarnêêng têêng ưng piđó.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Aku praaq lóóiq: Óóq ngaai ngóq aku nek ngôôk ngaak. Hayơq la kah, nek bhơt m'bưưiq phaai pơh đơơp aku kơi manưih ngôôk ngaak, buôn aku kung ve chóóm laach jơơr mưi m'bưưiq. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Rau hơq aku ravang praaq, nek eh rau aku praaq đuui Chuôq, bơơi kơi ngóq kalóóng rau xươl abhôh dhiq paraaq tarnêêng dhakơi đuôh laach jơơr ađô. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ơi taai bơk ngaai laach jơơr kơi manưih ti, hayơq aku kung e pajơơr. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ơi dhơ nek nôôq manưih tabech galang, bơơi adhi anó xók lóng bhuui bhe đơơp jruôn nôôq manưih ngôôk tôôh tôôh! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ơi la ngaai manưih dhơn ratơơq adhi anó, la ngaai manưih kap đah, la ngaai manưih pei jeng, la ngaai manưih tư hayuur pajơơr ađêi, la ngaai manưih m'bhiiq leq mat adhi anó, nek adhi anó bhiêk đơơp jruôn. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Aku praaq ting kơi kachiit mat, ngóq kơi nek chênh nôôq yi ơi po! Bơơi alua nek ngaai ve chóóm grâ lóóm kalóóng n'đó hót, aku xók praaq kalóóng rau xươl abhôh, nek aku kung grâ lóóm kơi achêk. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Piđó nek manưih Hê-bơ-rơ? Aku kung kơi achêk. Piđó nek manưih I-sơ-ra-êên? Aku kung kơi achêk. Piđó nek akóón chachau Ap-ra-haam? Aku kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Piđó nek dhơn ratơơq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih? (Aku praaq kơi ngóq pâng xươl) Aku hayơq lơh achêk dyơq: bơk lơh kalóóng vaaih kadhaap nhok, bơk lơh kalóóng đong kanam, kalóóng bhaniiq tanaach kah đuôh yaap, taluôn tơơt đan bhlưa akan chêt. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Xââng chu tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq, aku ơi jruôn puôn jêt tanaach, paxruiq mưi <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Pe chu aku bâân m'bhiiq palơq tarlââng. Mưi chu aku bâân glơm dhơl. Pe chu aku bâân klêch bhuông. Aku glêh pâng tarlum mưi tangêi mưi hayum dhiq taxiiq dhơuq; <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />đóók taluôn dhiq nôôq dharơp yuur vôôiq, bơk tarmenh dhiq karuung, tarmenh palơq kabhuh tatông, tarmenh gluh tââq manưih dhanuôr ađêi, tarmenh gluh tââq nôôq dhanuôr manưih nguôi, tarmenh kalóóng manưih bơk, tarmenh dhiq kruung vơng, tarmenh dhiq m'pơng taxiiq, tarmenh tââq adhi anó galơơk chachââr; <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />tarlum bơk jarnah xarngaat lơq kadhaap nhok, bơk bhêêl kalóóng tarlum kah bâân bêch, ha-ul lơq rahaal, đóók taluôn kalóóng tarlum drơng cha, chriêt khau lơq lalôh lalut; <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />tatrul leq ađek, lơh tââq nôôq rau têêh, rau karong kaboq leq aku dyóp tangêi nek lóóm karaang leq pabhơt nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ngaai dhur lóóm hơq aku kah dhur lóóm? Ngaai pâng têêng lơt hơq aku yươq pâng óch boh?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />La pa-eep phaai pajơơr, nek aku e yuur pajơơr nôôq rau dhur lóóm ưng aku. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Yaang Pleng, Ama ưng Chuôq Jê-su, Yaang ađaang chóóm bhi haanh đóng patơk nh'chró, n'nal kơi aku yươq praaq chachââr! <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Dhiq Đa-met, kuôn têêng gamak dhiq raal kataai bhua A-rê-ta biêh góón lêi kanóón Đa-met buôn kóóp jư aku, <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Hayơq tapâng mưi palóng aluh, aku ơi bâân xua padhaluônh palơq apơq mung tring ting jađơr garóóng kanóón, lơq aku ơi bâân loh tââq têi abhươp ađek.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Achêk nek pa-eep phaai pajơơr ađêi, dhơ kah đââng malơơi harau. Bơơi aku e vôôiq kơơq leq nôôq tapalêi lơq nôôq rau tapakah ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Aku n'nal mưi chanak kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, majêt puôn kamó laloom, ve tơơt kalóóng dyaang achak môôiq kah, aku kah n'nal, môôiq nek tơơt hót nguôi dyaang achak, aku kah n'nal, Yaang Pleng n'nal, mưih chanak kơi achêk ơi bâân đââng padyók đóng tơk talaang pleng đu pe. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Aku ơi n'nal mưi chanak kơi achêk, dhơ kalóóng dyaang achak môôiq nguôi dyaang achak, aku kah n'nal, Yaang Pleng n'nal <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />kơi manưih ađek ơi bâân đââng tơk Ba-ra-đi lơq ơi xâng nôôq paraaq kah chóóm praaq hơq kah đóng pheep mưi ngaai ngâ yuur praaq. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Leq mưi chanak kơi achêk, aku e pajơơr, bơơi leq chênh ađêi, aku e kah pajơơr, chapiên tơơt kalóóng nôôq rau dhur lóóm ưng aku. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ơi la aku rââm kiêng yuur pajơơr, nek aku e eh rau nek ngôôk ngaak, taai aku e praaq rau lalua. Bơơi aku gơt gađơq lóóiq, e vaaih mưi ngaai ađek ve chóóm kanóq leq aku jalơh lơh rau manưih achêk bâân lêi dhiq aku môôiq xâng tââq aku. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Ơi taai rau ve đaang chap ưng nôôq tapalêi, đóng hayơq buôn aku óóq val kơi laach jơơr, nek mưi axông huuch kalóóng achak araang, mưi abhưi abhóch ưng Sa-taan, ơi bâân đóng leq aku buôn ađó ve chóóm chanaaq janah aku, hơq đóng aku óóq val kơi laach jơơr. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Leq chiên ađôk, aku ơi mââl nhan Chuôq pe chu buôn Ađó thuôt lơơi ađó tââq aku. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Kơi achêk hơq Ađó ơi praaq palơq aku: “Ơơn phươk liêm ưng Aku nek dyóp đóng akóón, ơi mataai karơ ưng Aku bâân yuur têêng liêm dyóp kalóóng rau dhur lóóm.” Taai kơi achêk, aku e bhơt bhuui sương yuur pajơơr lơh dyơq kalóóng rau dhur lóóm ưng ađêi, hơq đóng mataai karơ ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih jaq tơơt dhiq aku. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Taai ađek, aku iêm lóóm kalóóng nôôq dhur lóóm, bharlưưk kađiq, haleng karnóq, chanaaq janah, menh chêt ơi taai Chuôq Paq Manưih; ơi n'đó bhêêl aku dhur lóóm, nek bhêêl ađek aku bâân karơ.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Aku ơi val kơi ngôôk ngaak; chênh adhi anó ơi pa-eep aku kơi achêk. Ơi aku biêh phaai bâân adhi anó bhi haanh, taai aku ơi yươq tabhuch mưi raurâ ưng nôôq “Sưưq-đô tabech galang” tôôh, dhơ aku patơk mơ nek kah rauriq. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Nôôq karnal ưng mưi sưưq-đô ơi bâân pakah têêng dhiq m'pơng adhi anó palơq tabhơt rau jruôn kađiq, palơq kanal chrih lơq raman chrih, palơq nôôq tarnêêng mataai karơ. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ơi n'dhiq nek rau hơq adhi anó bâân kah đuôh lơh nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq lââng, chapiên chiên chênh aku ơi kah têêng ganưi haleng đóng adhi anó? Phaai palơh lơơi đóng aku rau kah dhalam ađô!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Phaai lêi nô! Aku ơi ravang tơk palơq adhi anó chu đu pe ađô, lơq aku e kah tavaaih ve rau ganưi haleng. Ơi aku kah achêk tabâân nôôq karvaan kabhôôq ưng adhi anó, hơq nek chênh adhi anó. Ơi akóón anaaq eh rau koom ha-ơu đóng akonh akan, bơơi nek akonh akan koom ha-ơu đóng akóón anaaq. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Hayơq aku e lóng bhuui sương kơl cha, patơk mơ đơơp luh-lung pabhơt ơi taai yaang ravaai adhi anó. Ve kơq xók nh'nhơr adhi anó bơk lơh, nek aku bâân nh'nhơr m'bưưiq lơh? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Bơơi phaai bhiêk lơơi kơi achêk, chênh aku ơi kah têêng ganưi haleng đóng adhi anó, dhơ kơi ađek, taai nek manưih bhriêl tarbech, aku ơi pei pa-eep adhi anó palơq bhriêl tarbech. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ve kơq mưi ngaai ađek, nek manưih aku glêh kayua tơk leq adhi anó, hơq aku ơi tapâng manưih achêk kapươk malua adhi anó? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Aku ơi bhơơl chut Tiit lơq kayua mưi chanak adhi anó lââng ting vôôiq palơq ađó achêk. Hơq ve lua Tiit ơi kapươk malua adhi anó kơq? Nôôq yi ơi kah jađaang vôôiq palơq mađó mưi lóóm karnóq alua? Kah madhiq nôôq lóih dyung alua?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />N'loom ahei, ve lua adhi anó ngóq kơi nôôq yi xók tư praaq xalaai palơq adhi anó? Nôôq yi nek xók praaq toom mat Yaang Pleng, kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih. Bơơi adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr ơơi, pabhơt nôôq rau ađô nek taai malơơi đóng tarnêêng têêng hayuur adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Taai aku karaang kakhin, kakhin e ting kơi-kiq ađek, xong xók tơk, aku óóq chóóm ve lêi adhi anó kơi nôôq rau hơq aku rââm kiêng, aku kung óóq bâân adhi anó lêi kơi rau hơq adhi anó rââm đương; vaaih ve tââq tiq ađek rau tarkaai tarlak, makhinh, grâ jar-ââih, tambhiiq tampah, praaq uôr, raxiq-raxóq dhiq hóng, próng kriing, nhôôn nhaauq, <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />kakhin e xong xók aku tơk machu dyơq, Yaang Pleng ưng aku ve chóóm têêng aku kachiit mat leq adhi anó, lơq aku kung phaai nhiim griit đóng bơk manưih kalóóng bơk nôôq manưih xók n'loom hei ơi têêng matu lơq ơi kah klôôq lóóm leq tarnêêng anhuq, taniêt tapiing, lơq padheng achak hơq piđó ơi têêng.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Ađô nek chu đu pe aku tơk palơq adhi anó. “Dyóp bhiêk chiên e bâân klôôq paliêm ganơơm dhiq paraaq ưng bơơr môôiq pe chanak truuih đuui.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Aku ơi praaq loom kơi xók tơk chu đu bơơr, lơq xók ađôk, dhơ xók kah ve mat, aku kung praaq, palơq nôôq manưih xók n'loom ơi têêng matu, palơq pabhơt nôôq manưih dyơq lóóiq, kơi la aku ve chóóm tơk dhiq ađô machu dyơq, aku e kah lơơi lơt mơ, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Ơi taai adhi anó xók mââl tamóh rau ngi lêi Chuôq Paq Manưih praaq pachóóm dhiq aku, nek Yaang kah dhur lóóm nek palơq adhi anó mơ, bơơi bing praan mataai dhiq m'pơng adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Taai Ađó ơi tââq dhiq dhur lóóm đơơp teeng đinh dhiq m'baang chatông, bơơi Ađó dyơq mamông tââq mataai karơ ưng Yaang Pleng. Taai nôôq yi kung dhur lóóm kalóóng Ađó, bơơi nek palơq adhi anó, nôôq yi e mamông palơq Ađó tââq mataai karơ ưng Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Adhi anó phaai haliq lêi kala achak ve alua nek ađêi xók tơơt kalóóng lóóm huuiq. Phaai drêh lalua chênh ađêi. Môôiq adhi anó kah đơơp n'nal dhơ dhakơi leq kala achak kơi Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt kalóóng ađêi alua, la kơi achêk, hơq ve alua adhi anó nek galơơk chachââr kơq? <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Bơơi aku đương rââm nek adhi anó e đơơp n'nal kơi chênh nôôq yi eh rau nek galơơk chachââr. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Hayơq nôôq yi gavơh nhan palơq Yaang Pleng buôn adhi anó óóq têêng dhơ dharau n'đó lơt môôp, eh rau buôn chênh nôôq yi ve chóóm pakah ađêi nek đaang ngaai đươi, bơơi nek buôn chênh adhi anó ve chóóm têêng rau dhalam liêm, dhơ đóng chênh nôôq yi nek kơi ngóq kah bâân ngaai đươi. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ơi nôôq yi kah ve chóóm têêng mưi rau huông palơq paraaq dhalam, palâh lóóiq nôôq yi nek taai paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Ơi nôôq yi bhuui marhaal xók nôôq yi nek dhur lóóm hayơq adhi anó bâân karơ. Nôôq yi kung gavơh nhan đóng rau ađô: rau bhơt liêm ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ơi taai rau achêk, xók bhêêl kah ve mat, aku xaraq nôôq rau ađô, buôn xók ve mat, aku yươq phaai praaq xêi kơi râng tamarươih ting praan kataai hơq Chuôq ơi đóng leq aku đóng leq tarnêêng têêng hayuur, hơq eh rau malóóm tơk tarnêêng rơh pahư.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Xariêq tatun, nhan móón adhi anó, phaai bhuui marhaal! Phaai malóóm tơk rau liêm dhalam, phaai lơơi ađêi bâân tabhơơl, phaai ve markơi lóóm kanóq, phaai mamông paliêm lóóiq. Yaang Pleng ưng lóóm tanhơr lơq yươq rauha e tơơt palơq adhi anó.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Phaai chap yayar xóng ađêi palơq chanum liêm. Tabhơt nôôq manưih huuiq Chuôq chap yayar adhi anó.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Nhan ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, palơq lóóm nh'nhơr ưng Yaang Pleng lơq rau mađó madhiq ưng Chuôq Yaang Liêm tơơt palơq tabhơt adhi anó.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>